  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc56:2.1.6": "According to [pli-tv-bu-vb-pc69:2.1.21]() _saṁvāsa_, here rendered as “community”, refers to formal meetings of the community. The present rule refers to formal meetings where both monks and nuns are present. ",
  "pli-tv-bi-vb-pc56:2.1.7": "“Yard” renders _pariveṇa_. For a discussion of this word, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
